@format 1
@id tabs.close
@title Close tab
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Close one tab, dispose its workspace, and choose the next current tab.
@section I. UI
@tabs Global interface
@flow TB
@related tabs.add, tabs.select

@alias navigator = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.PTabNavigator
@alias tabset = Cadroue.UIShell.PControlBar.LTabset

[input] Tab close requested <input>
- Receive the close gesture for a tab record @ navigator.PTabCloseHandle(...)
> close

[close] Remove tab <process>
- Close the workspace and remove its record @ tabset.LTabsetClose(...)
- Select an adjacent surviving tab and refresh titles and separators @ tabset.LTabsetClose(...)
> result

[result] Tab closed <output>
= The closed workspace no longer participates in the tab set or session capture.
